{"version":1,"content":"<p>屯門「樂在屯門──觀鳥步行節」嘉年華將於10月31日至11月1日（周六、周日）在屯門文娛廣場（屯門大會堂外）舉行。</p><p>活動包括展覽、有助認識候鳥遷徙、鳥類特徵及棲息地的攤位遊戲、手作工作坊、面部彩繪等。</p><p>［工作坊報名連結］</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T07:20:48.575768+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T06:41:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T15:38:10.573289+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T07:18:06.209893+00:00","content_hash":"911db319386afd4c0e2637e36af6e6eabed9cdaf7343963b16903f1063889547","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}